<p>Requires the four disks of the AGA release (or the HCC two-disk repack).</p>
<h2>Controls</h2>
<div class="row"><span class="label">F1 to F8</span><span class="state">on a table: start a game for that many players</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">Shift / Alt</span><span class="state">left and right flippers</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">Down</span><span class="state">pull the plunger; let go to launch the ball</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">Space</span><span class="state">nudge the table</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="label">Esc</span><span class="state">quit the table</span></div>
